# wrapscan path allowances — root-relative globs.
# docs/research/ holds verbatim founding-research records: wide markdown
# tables and source URLs that cannot wrap without breaking table syntax or
# mangling quoted material. The house 85-column limit binds everywhere else
# — keep this glob exactly this narrow.
docs/research/**

# docs/SESSIONS.md is the session INDEX (RECORD.md § The session log, adopted
# here 2026-08-17): one deliberately long line per session, so a whole session's
# scope stays greppable on a single line. Wrapping them would defeat the format,
# and the format is the point. atelier carries the identical entry for its own
# index. The DETAIL files under docs/sessions/ are ordinary prose and stay gated.
docs/SESSIONS.md
